    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Prio and go through different levels and get to the end! Experience two dimensions as you jump through platforms or navigate through mazes. From the open-space 3D world to a classic-style 2D world, you'll face different levels throughout the game.<br><br><strong>Play in 3D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through different levels with unique challenges and multiple ways of overcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/4670fd9c2ce0dcb2d84810e0151c0167.poster.avif?t=1749740179\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/4670fd9c2ce0dcb2d84810e0151c0167.webm?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/4670fd9c2ce0dcb2d84810e0151c0167.mp4?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the two worlds meet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in 2D as you encounter special levels that progress after beating the unique minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3d9a3447fc5b054fee674cfd49423738.poster.avif?t=1749740179\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3d9a3447fc5b054fee674cfd49423738.webm?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3d9a3447fc5b054fee674cfd49423738.mp4?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or just play classic, fully in 2D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tone down the game and play in one dimension less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/d492004fad7650fc4378d6422c6b4b3c.poster.avif?t=1749740179\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/d492004fad7650fc4378d6422c6b4b3c.webm?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/d492004fad7650fc4378d6422c6b4b3c.mp4?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or play infinitely to your hearts desire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your adventure, play longer and see how far you can go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3397b3c5c94e76c8bcb80bc7519cdcfe.avif?t=1749740179\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and experience a different gameplay based on the mode you pick. <strong>Don't die though or else you'll be back at the start!\u00a0</strong>Play a new set of levels that change with each playthrough. Get to the end to claim victory! Who knows what you'll find there...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Prio and go through different levels and get to the end! Experience two dimensions as you jump through platforms or navigate through mazes. From the open-space 3D world to a classic-style 2D world, you'll face different levels throughout the game.<br><br><strong>Play in 3D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go through different levels with unique challenges and multiple ways of overcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/4670fd9c2ce0dcb2d84810e0151c0167.poster.avif?t=1749740179\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/4670fd9c2ce0dcb2d84810e0151c0167.webm?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/4670fd9c2ce0dcb2d84810e0151c0167.mp4?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the two worlds meet</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in 2D as you encounter special levels that progress after beating the unique minigame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3d9a3447fc5b054fee674cfd49423738.poster.avif?t=1749740179\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3d9a3447fc5b054fee674cfd49423738.webm?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3d9a3447fc5b054fee674cfd49423738.mp4?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or just play classic, fully in 2D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tone down the game and play in one dimension less.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/d492004fad7650fc4378d6422c6b4b3c.poster.avif?t=1749740179\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/d492004fad7650fc4378d6422c6b4b3c.webm?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/d492004fad7650fc4378d6422c6b4b3c.mp4?t=1749740179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or play infinitely to your hearts desire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your adventure, play longer and see how far you can go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675570/extras/3397b3c5c94e76c8bcb80bc7519cdcfe.avif?t=1749740179\" data-has-big width=800 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and experience a different gameplay based on the mode you pick. <strong>Don't die though or else you'll be back at the start!\u00a0</strong>Play a new set of levels that change with each playthrough. Get to the end to claim victory! Who knows what you'll find there...</p>",
    "short_description": "A mish-mash of a maze and a platformer within both 2D and 3D!",
